{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q6716768","formula":"C₁₁H₁₅NO₃","hill":"C11H15NO3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":11.0,"H":15.0,"N":1.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"(RS)-2-methoxy-4,5-methylenedioxyamphetamine","ru":"MMDA-2"},"descriptions":{"en":"MMDA-2, also known as 2-methoxy-4,5-methylenedioxyamphetamine or as 6-methoxy-MDA, is a psychedelic drug of the phenethylamine, amphetamine, and MDxx families. It is the 6-methoxy derivative of MDA and is a positional isomer of MMDA (5-methoxy-MDA).","ru":"MMDA-2 (2-метокси-4,5-метилендиоксиамфетамин) — психоделический наркотик класса амфетаминов. Он тесно связан с MMDA и MDA. Александр Шульгин, вероятно, был первым, кто синтезировал MMDA-2. В его книге PiHKAL доза указана как 25-50 мг, а продолжительность действия указана как 8-12 часов."},"fame":9,"pubchemCid":90966,"mass":209.24,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(CC1=CC2=C(C=C1OC)OCO2)N","inchikey":"GPVJAXJRAZVITB-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1-(6-methoxy-1,3-benzodioxol-5-yl)propan-2-amine","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"90966","atoms":30,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":2.584,"y":-1.769,"z":-0.432,"el":"O"},{"x":3.38,"y":0.319,"z":0.468,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.026,"y":2.258,"z":0.371,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.161,"y":-1.437,"z":-0.333,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.073,"y":-0.172,"z":-0.697,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.76,"y":-1.317,"z":0.082,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.626,"y":0.007,"z":-0.37,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.161,"y":1.226,"z":0.155,"el":"C"},{"x":0.256,"y":-1.053,"z":-0.594,"el":"C"},{"x":1.585,"y":-0.857,"z":-0.282,"el":"C"},{"x":2.04,"y":0.336,"z":0.232,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.724,"y":-1.094,"z":1.594,"el":"C"},{"x":1.19,"y":1.398,"z":0.463,"el":"C"},{"x":3.718,"y":-1.018,"z":0.045,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.221,"y":3.173,"z":-0.704,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.644,"y":0.749,"z":-0.531,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.151,"y":-0.368,"z":-1.775,"e